# final: run 2's configuration, chosen by the user at gate G3 on 2026-11-13 after run r20261112-1520.
# Deploy step 7 applies it before the first start (BENCH_ARM_FILE).
# The vote fix in its always-on form, the vote queue fix, the epoch record state check and the
# whole-map advice: run 1's v-vote-floor arm. Every other switch stays at its default (the pool
# switches, pipelined persist, the admission bound and the parent grace are off).
# No host step: a node that never started has nothing to evict, and the advice must be on in the
# FIRST process (run 1: every node stopped prefaulting in its first process after genesis, and only
# a restart or this switch ends that state).
build bench6
name final
param mdbx_random_advice true
param quorum_exec_block true
param quorum_exec_block_starved_rounds 0
param vote_queue_fix true
param epoch_record_state_check true
